{"id":1176,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p></p><p><br></p><p>清风解暑意，万物入清秋。9月16日上午9时，信息与通信工程学院（人工智能学院）2026级新生开学典礼暨入学教育大会在科艺苑隆重举行。学院党委书记孙豫峰、院长王黎明、教学副院长陈友兴、校友代表、各专业负责人、教师代表、辅导员、新生班班主任、2026级新生及家长代表参加。学院党委副书记么兰主持大会。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UL4GnaMRARLlUaMSzNZnNVRL4liLzvz8L4C8L8L8LNr2MzG0gihFp2hmCIa0USh7n1yiLYy4n7rfLln7nNlZMzlPLmL8LRfRL4W7M4rVL4rFnz-4nRM7ozfFoR-sL8CJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM49bgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/ADF533DEA1DDFE855123400C32D75E35/E23D3D90/8273F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UM4CnZM7CaL4LiMSmC4LlQkLmLYnl-zbUNV7UN-PM8lsUzG0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y8nSyPnkhkU4vsolL4MRVRLN7bMzGPozUPL8M7U4MRM4TFM8WkU8-ZnNnFLmLin77DgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRvZoSbw62l8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UMNCnYMzCDnlnRoSRCYU8WkMzliLm7zaM8r2UmnkoRA7n7U0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ybnkybL1yYMmffM4WfLl7aMzf2nz9PLml4Lz78MR-PMzVFnRCYnmUPM4QFMRA2LN7Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM49bgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/29D92260A72A1A050FE8125311442151/D62F4176/48F2A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UM7lniUzCbM8lPnSzV2MzV7L7M7UmTzRUzU4LmGPL8C8nlU0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh7M1yDLYysoz7aL4UZLzGsMRvDMmrfozGsM49io7-4U46FnllaM46knRVFLzl8LR7sgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRvZoSbw62l8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\"></p><p>大会在庄严的国歌声中开幕。院长王黎明首先作学院介绍，围绕学院历史沿革、学科专业、师资队伍、人才培养和科研实力等方面，向新生全面展示了学院深厚的办学底蕴和鲜明特色，寄语新生怀揣热忱追梦，不负韶华好时光；脚踏实地笃行，自成青春大文章。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Uol7n8oz9DL49PLSmM7nmNanlrkLR-zPLzWRnRTVL7laU8C0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yPU1yiUSyPo7l4LmnRnRUZnzGYnRNYMmARUN-ZUzVfL4MFoRQVUN-4MlrFMR-Dol7Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM49bgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/21B5A18E324CD48E02D9268CBB8A1A33/86EBB35E/4269A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UozAn2nzA2nmrfnSm7anR7ZUmCDUmCziMRTkoRlaLlMkMmN0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyiUYh2MSh2nzvioz-aLzf7Ml78MlrVUmvinlUDMmlDMlrFUNQ2UNWRn7MFnlV7LmLJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM49bgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\"></p><p>院党委书记孙豫峰致辞时，以“守正道、求真知、担大任”寄语新生：守正道，保持独立思考，不被算法“硬控”；求真知，让AI当“队友”而非“枪手”，在项目实践中练就工程思维；担大任，将小我融入大我，在“十五五”开局之年勇担时代使命。他勉励大家：“人生没有标准答案，但永远有最优解，而那个解在你们自己手里。”</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ULRfn7nmWfUlW7MSR67UlQkUzL4nRfzRM4NYnRVRMm7PMzU0gihFp2hmCIa0oSysMkh2n1h2oz67MzLPnNLbMm67nm-bnl-Yozr7olM2oR6FLlUYnm9inmAFM4-aMRvJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM49bgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/974FFF97D531FC967DF29EB295D9CF87/1D2F85F8/72047\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ULzMnfMR67LmA2MSRGanlV2U8C8MRNzYUz7iLmLPUmNinlU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yPnky4U1h7ollPoR-4MRnkMRviUmLaUlUaLRl4MNnVMNVFL7QVn7MRLmWFLzlZLRrfgjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRvZoSbw62l8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.png\"></p><p>教师代表、第九届全国高等学校电子信息类专业青年教师授课竞赛全国一等奖获得者侯慧玲寄语新生：以目标为引，以自学为翼，以平和之心，聚协作之力，脚踏实地，勇于实践，在信息与通信工程学院书写属于自己的青春答卷。校友代表、学院07级毕业生武晓媛结合自身经历，勉励新生珍惜大学时光，练就过硬专业本领；注重英语能力提升，拓展国际化发展边界；善用身边资源，主动向师长请教、与同窗切磋；利用好寒暑假实践机会，锻造个人长板。在校生代表、2023级光电信息科学与工程专业学生刘佳怡分享了大学成长体会，建议新生夯实专业基础、投身创新实践、丰富校园生活。新生代表、人工智能专业学生刘子涵发言中，号召新生常怀感恩之心求知，以务实态度做事，带着热忱稳步成长，在中北看见更辽阔的风景，成为更有力量的自己。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UL7-nZnzQVnmGPUS4NsUllZnNMVM7nz2M8U8oRliM87aMm-0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhVM1yPnSyZMmMRLzTkUzT2L8WknR6VnNUDo7W2LzWRnNMFM8Mfoz6RMm6FMmn2MlUJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM49bgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4E61E863C19BA9F3BBD7EFD68BF12CFC/7CA97C67/64F5D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UUm6n7MNLsMR9aoSz-aL8liU87bUzUzaUm9YMNr7o7CaLRG0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVUSy4USh2UmC4LRTfLNlanzfVM49ZnRWfLzCiL4CPLRfFU4W7LmCZL4QFL8VVMmNZgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRvZoSbw62l8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\"></p><p>大会还开展了“启新 知礼 感恩 承责”活动，引导新生在仪式教育中开启新程、知礼明德、心怀感恩、勇承责任，完成从高中生到大学生、从“新同学”到“信通人”的角色转变。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UnN-nDLzUZnNnkUSlL4Lz7PLzQRMzNzPMR9DM7rkLmTfozU0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkybn1y4MkysLzGaUmT7MRLZnlUPUlQ2oR-sMzlDM8r2UmQFnmTfoRLYn7WFMzLanm9Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM49bgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/09F347100B9D438ED1AFF8275567EFB6/F9A832DB/530F8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UUNWnfUNWfnm-inSRCbL8lsUzA2nm9zYMRCPo7n2nRCZLR70gihFp2hmCIa0M1yiM1y8LSybnlMRU49DM8VRUzW2oRNYnzVRoR6Vn7LDozrFLlCDU49aM7nFLlnVoRQ7gtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRvZoSbw62l8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UM4fnRnmUboRf7LSNM2nmW7LlV7UzNzsnllZM4Tfoz9ao770gihFp2hmCIa0LYhRMSyDMkysUlL8L8LbnlMkU8U8UmlsUNVkoz6VM4C8n7rFM4NsL4lsM4VFM7CYnzUJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM49bgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3C5647AC43C9ECBCD4B57BAB97E764DE/79735771/4F2E4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UnRVnRoRC8Uz9PMSm-DM4liM7lYLmMzRLmQknNCPL8QRnlL0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh2USyDokybMmrVL4T2UNMkUz-so7UioRrVozlDnRCiLmVFM7lbLzUPMmTFLlWRM8r7gtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRvZoSbw62l8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UL8CnbL87sLmU8oSzU8ozl8Mm74MznzRMmlYUmARM4LZLNC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh7U1hVUYhkMNMRMNCiU8UaozCZMm-8ozNaMm-YoR7PLzTFUzC4o7Q2MmfFMllsLRLJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM49bgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DDBECB6CC6F5CD096862499062281119/A638FF60/5E703\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UnmWn2nR7DL8CaLSmWknz-aL4r2M8lzsLzCaLz78LRLiLzU0gihFp2hmCIa0UShRUYhfL1yaoRUYLzWVLzV7L8CbozviMN7so7MRnRUaLNnFLzlaUmCsLzfFLmW7M4C4gtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRvZoSbw62l8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg\"></p><p>典礼在众人齐声高唱校歌《再铸辉煌》中落幕。随后入学教育环节中，太原市公安局尖草坪区分局上兰派出所反诈讲师马晨焜、中北大学大学生心理发展指导中心主任李晓彧、信息与通信工程学院组织员陈淑霞分别围绕校园安全、防范电信网络诈骗，大学适应和入党启蒙教育作专题讲解，帮助新生尽快适应大学生活，为学业发展奠定坚实基础。</p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UL4GnaMRARLlUaMSzNZnNVRL4liLzvz8L4C8L8L8LNr2MzG0gihFp2hmCIa0USh7n1yiLYy4n7rfLln7nNlZMzlPLmL8LRfRL4W7M4rVL4rFnz-4nRM7ozfFoR-sL8CJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM49bgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18789&e=.jpg"}